      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-07T11:36:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's an important distinction also, because it will mean that the GM is deciding whether certain character types are simply going to overpower certain scenes or not.</p>\n<p>The good thing is is that you can be flexible with it also, so when you *want* the scene to showcase a large number of multiple attacks, while other times it will be more restricted.</p>",
